  sources:
  - name: MVG Fahrleistung und Energieverbrauch Bus und Strassenbahn 2019-2024
    authority: Mainzer Mobilitaet (MVG) -- Florian Sturm; ueber Mainzer 
      Stadtwerke AG
    url:
    description: "Annual vehicle kilometres and final energy for the municipal public
      transport fleet of Mainz, split by traction type (Dieselbus, Elektrobus, Brennstoffzellenbus,
      Strassenbahn). Mileage from odometer readings (KM-Zaehler), energy from supplier
      invoices (Rechnungen). Diesel converted with the workbook's own net calorific
      value of 9.86 kWh/l. Delivered 2026-06-22 in VERBRAUCH_FAHRLEISTUNG_Autobus_Strassenbahn_2019-2024_StadtwerkeMainz_20260622.xlsx.;
      Format: .xlsx; Licensing: Provided to the city for climate accounting; not public;
      Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000); Update Frequency: Annual; Date Last
      Updated: 2026-06-22; Updated by: Mainzer Stadtwerke AG"
  - name: Klimaschutzplaner Export Mainz Strassenverkehr 2019-2023
    authority: Landeshauptstadt Mainz -- Gruen- und Umweltamt; export from the 
      Klimaschutzplaner tool via the ksp-extract pipeline
    url:
    description: 'Territorial road-transport final energy for Mainz by vehicle class
      and fuel, 2019-2023, read from the Klimaschutzplaner input fields EEV_<Pkw|LNF|Lkw|MZR|Lbus|Rbus>_<fuel>
      plus EEV_SSU for tram. Local vehicle registrations extrapolated with national
      consumption factors; the Klimaschutzplaner grades these 0.5 (Datenguete B) itself
      and that grade is carried over rather than re-derived. Covers the four car/van/truck/motorcycle
      classes in full. The series ends in 2023, so no 2024 value exists; the tram
      figure for 2019 (8 MWh against 9570 in 2018 and 11958 in 2022) is corrupt in
      the source and is taken from MVG instead.; Format: .parquet; Licensing: Provided
      to the city; not public; Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000); Update Frequency:
      Annual; Date Last Updated: 2026-08-19; Updated by: Landeshauptstadt Mainz'
  - name: KSP-Export Straßenverkehr Mainz 2017-2024
    authority: Landeshauptstadt Mainz -- Gruen- und Umweltamt; dedizierte 
      Einzelabfrage im Klimaschutzplaner
    url:
    description: 'Per-vehicle-class KSP query (Mot. Zweiraeder, PKWs, Leichte Nutzfahrzeuge,
      LKWs, Linienbusse, Strassen-/Stadt-/U-Bahn), 2017-2024. Used for the 2024 column
      of mainz/energieverbrauch_strassenverkehr (32 of 38 required cells; coach_buses
      has no sheet in this file). Quality taken at face value from KSP, matching the
      existing 2019-2023 convention for this dataset (unlike the rail/water/air dataset,
      where it is downgraded).; Format: xlsx; Licensing: Provided to the city; not
      public; Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000); Update Frequency: Superseded
      -- single delivery; Date Last Updated: 2026-08-26; Updated by: Landeshauptstadt
      Mainz'
  units:
    Value: MWh/a
    quality: ''
